 comes to our pond to keep cool"}],["1655964788",138.57402,-35.02605,15947,20,145,null,null,"",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"2013-08-30",{"version":1,"datasetKey":"dad84e72-95f7-4709-b564-72a4429942b1","occurrenceId":"106bfb16-4e91-47e2-aba6-41f86a395c09","catalogNumber":"urn:lsid:bdrs.ala.org.au:Record:117258","uri":"https://www.gbif.org/occurrence/1655964788","behavior":"Other,Sitting,Sleeping","notes":"Mother koala was sleeping. She woke up, yawned and stretched, then brought the joey around from her side to her chest, snuggled her in to her chest and then went back to sleep."}],["1655966667",138.57209,-35.02511,15923,20,145,null,null,"",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"2013-08-06",{"version":1,"datasetKey":"dad84e72-95f7-4709-b564-72a4429942b1","occurrenceId":"db71128b-045a-4f94-9f25-b9415f744ff2","catalogNumber":"urn:lsid:bdrs.ala.org.au:Record:97685","uri":"https://www.gbif.org/occurrence/1655966667","behavior":"Climbing,Eating,Sitting"}],["1655964932",138.56274,-35.02815,15669,20,145,null,null,"",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"2012-11-25",{"version":1,"datasetKey":"dad84e72-95f7-4709-b564-72a4429942b1","occurrenceId":"c1c2e823-5efa-4b7f-a665-1d744b31fccd","catalogNumber":"urn:lsid:bdrs.ala.org.au:Record:86805","uri":"https://www.gbif.org/occurrence/1655964932","behavior":"Sleeping","notes":"Koala is in a tree next to our house on 5 acres of and sitting and eating in a eucalypt tree.  It has a yellow tag in it's left ear and appears to be very healthy"}],["1655965049",138.57488,-35.01205,15672,20,145,null,null,"",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"2012-11-28",{"version":1,"datasetKey":"dad84e72-95f7-4709-b564-72a4429942b1","occurrenceId":"b7768fb9-7831-4141-90cf-1aa3368e44b7","catalogNumber":"urn:lsid:bdrs.ala.org.au:Record:86936","uri":"https://www.gbif.org/occurrence/1655965049","behavior":"Sleeping"}],["1655965106",138.59572,-35.02451,15672,20,145,null,null,"",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"2012-11-28",{"version":1,"datasetKey":"dad84e72-95f7-4709-b564-72a4429942b1","occurrenceId":"7eed5b1a-204e-4469-a736-73098959a7c3","catalogNumber":"urn:lsid:bdrs.ala.org.au:Record:87025","uri":"https://www.gbif.org/occurrence/1655965106","behavior":"Sitting,Sleeping","notes":"A family of koalas have been coming each summer into our garden (very expansive with lots of grey box and other large shade trees) for the last 3 years."}],["1655965294",138.55444,-35.02093,15672,20,145,null,null,"",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"2012-11-28",{"version":1,"datasetKey":"dad84e72-95f7-4709-b564-72a4429942b1","occurrenceId":"de74cde2-008b-43d6-9820-431e5f290e26","catalogNumber":"urn:lsid:bdrs.ala.org.au:Record:87153","uri":"https://www.gbif.org/occurrence/1655965294","behavior":"Climbing","notes":"First koalas (Mum and baby) in the 7 years that we have lived here. Had a male come to visit for the weekend about a month ago but hasnt been back since"}],["1655965435",138.57328,-35.02499,15672,20,145,null,null,"",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"2012-11-28",{"version":1,"datasetKey":"dad84e72-95f7-4709-b564-72a4429942b1","occurrenceId":"54623caa-2133-4c24-840c-20978cbb109d","catalogNumber":"urn:lsid:bdrs.ala.org.au:Record:87363","uri":"https://www.gbif.org/occurrence/1655965435","behavior":"Sitting,Sleeping","notes":"It is not unusual/surprising to see a koala on Flinders Uni campus as there are lots of Eucalypt trees and natural habitat, yet each time I see one it gives me such joy and I think what a privilege it is to be sharing their environment with them.  How lucky am I? One of  the uni gardeners also tells me that there is one particular koala, regularly found in a certain area on campus, that he can give a pat to and tickle behind its ears!"}],["1655965469",138.57125,-35.02553,15672,20,145,null,null,"",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"2012-11-28",{"version":1,"datasetKey":"dad84e72-95f7-4709-b564-72a4429942b1","occurrenceId":"219064aa-9d0b-4a32-8a9f-50859264a2e0","catalogNumber":"urn:lsid:bdrs.ala.org.au:Record:87378","uri":"https://www.gbif.org/occurrence/1655965469","behavior":"Climbing"}],["1655965479",138.57414,-35.02616,15672,20,145,null,null,"",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"2012-11-28",{"version":1,"datasetKey":"dad84e72-95f7-4709-b564-72a4429942b1","occurrenceId":"79fb27b4-93b4-4548-b9da-630d5a634e7d","catalogNumber":"urn:lsid:bdrs.ala.org.au:Record:87421","uri":"https://www.gbif.org/occurrence/1655965479","behavior":"Climbing","notes":"The koala made its way through the undercover car park (Car Park 5) at Flinders Uni and climbed the Eucalyptus tree overhanging the upper deck  �  it was at eye level for the photo. What a joy!"}],["1655965502",138.5837,-35.04569,15672,20,145,null,null,"",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"2012-11-28",{"version":1,"datasetKey":"dad84e72-95f7-4709-b564-72a4429942b1","occurrenceId":"29a81960-00a3-484c-b77e-d7abda220441","catalogNumber":"urn:lsid:bdrs.ala.org.au:Record:87453","uri":"https://www.gbif.org/occurrence/1655965502","behavior":"Sitting","notes":"Young femsle"}],["1655965520",138.57339,-35.02614,15672,20,145,null,null,"",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"2012-11-28",{"version":1,"datasetKey":"dad84e72-95f7-4709-b564-72a4429942b1","occurrenceId":"92a8b9f6-2f22-4b8f-9379-aa3da4107e3d","catalogNumber":"urn:lsid:bdrs.ala.org.au:Record:87402","uri":"https://www.gbif.org/occurrence/1655965520","behavior":"Walking","notes":"I had parked my car in the undercover car park at Flinders Uni and I was about to leave for home. As I approached my car I saw an animal (which I thought was a dog) wandering amongst the parked cars.  However, I got such a surprise when I got closer to it, to discover it was a koala!! I looked at it, it looked at me - both of us startled - and then  it took off.  Boy can they run! Normally, sighting a koala on campus isn�t that unusual, but I certainly wasn�t expecting to see one in the car park!"}],["1655965596",138.58711,-35.04384,15672,20,145,null,null,"",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"2012-11-28",{"version":1,"datasetKey":"dad84e72-95f7-4709-b564-72a4429942b1","occurrenceId":"3812362d-3bcb-47ae-9664-d61f6dcb5393","catalogNumber":"urn:lsid:bdrs.ala.org.au:Record:87517","uri":"https://www.gbif.org/occurrence/1655965596","behavior":"Sitting","notes":"Adult female"}],["1655966396",138.58308,-35.01866,15671,20,145,null,null,"",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"2012-11-27",{"version":1,"datasetKey":"dad84e72-95f7-4709-b564-72a4429942b1","occurrenceId":"6e4a0ab4-147f-4056-a53a-d24ce4ab997a","catalogNumber":"urn:lsid:bdrs.ala.org.au:Record:88488","uri":"https://www.gbif.org/occurrence/1655966396","sex":"Male","behavior":"Climbing,Drinking,Eating,Sitting,Sleeping,Walking","notes":"The photos are of him walking onto our block, climbing, eating and sounding in the sugar gum.  The additional photos are of him in our back patio during last years hot weather where he drank and sat in the bowl shown"}],["1655966428",138.59482,-35.02211,15676,20,145,null,null,"",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"2012-12-02",{"version":1,"datasetKey":"dad84e72-95f7-4709-b564-72a4429942b1","occurrenceId":"7a6f0a69-0634-4a36-a21a-ce4491cf76eb","catalogNumber":"urn:lsid:bdrs.ala.org.au:Record:88386","uri":"https://www.gbif.org/occurrence/1655966428","behavior":"Sleeping","notes":"A second koala is in the neighbour's property."}],["1655966474",138.59079,-35.02599,15681,20,145,null,null,"",null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,"2012-12-07",{"version":1,"datasetKey":"dad84e72-95f7-4709-b564-72a4429942b1","occurrenceId":"d579048a-f470-48b1-b1eb-366235cbc16c","catalogNumber":"urn:lsid:bdrs.ala.org.au:Record:88679","uri":"https://www.gbif.org/occurrence/1655966474","behavior":"Walking"}],["1655966260",138.59309,-35.00958,15672,20,145,null,null,"",null,null,null,null,null,null,null